// Question

Write a SystemVerilog class Packet with the following requirements:

It should have:
rand bit [7:0] addr
rand bit [7:0] data
Add a constraint such that:
addr is always between 10 and 20
Include a display() method to print values
In a testbench:
Create an object
Randomize it
Print the value
*/

class packet;
rand bit[7:0]addr;
rand bit[7:0]data;

function void f_n(input bit [7:0] m_addr, bit [7:0] m_data);
data = m_data;
addr= m_addr;
endfunction
task display();
$display("Address: %0d, Data: %0d", addr, data);
endtask
endclass
module testbench;
initial begin
packet p1;
bit [7:0] addr, data;
p1 = new();
addr = $urandom_range(10,20);
data = $urandom_range(0,255);

p1.f_n(addr, data);
p1.display();
end 

endmodule



